00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:30.200
So, credit cycling is when you hit your

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:31.720
limit, pay it down, and then use it up

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.040
to your limit multiple times within a

00:06:31.720 --> 00:06:34.720
billing cycle.

00:06:33.040 --> 00:06:36.640
You're basically reusing the same credit

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:37.880
